## 1. Permission to Modify

Permission is granted to modify, adapt, improve, or build upon this software, provided that the resulting work contains substantial and clearly identifiable modifications.

A modification is considered substantial only if it meaningfully changes the functionality, behavior, features, code, user interface, or other significant aspects of the original software.

## 2. Redistribution

Redistribution of the original software, or a modified version that does not contain substantial and clearly identifiable modifications, is strictly prohibited.

The following are NOT considered substantial modifications:

* Renaming the mod.
* Changing only the version number.
* Changing only the description.
* Changing only the icon, logo, or other cosmetic assets.
* Changing metadata files without meaningful changes to the software.
* Repackaging, re-uploading, or mirroring the original mod.
* Making trivial code changes that do not meaningfully alter the software.

A modified version must provide meaningful changes beyond the original software.

## 3. Attribution

Any redistribution of a modified version must clearly and visibly credit the original author:

**Original author: Youcef Bouz**

The attribution must also include a reference to the original project:

**Original project: [INSERT ORIGINAL MOD LINK]**

The attribution must not be removed, hidden, or replaced.

## 4. No Misrepresentation

Modified versions must not be presented as the original software.

The distributor must clearly indicate that the version has been modified.

For example:

> This is a modified version of [Mod Name], originally created by Youcef Bouz.

## 5. Commercial Use

Commercial use and monetization of substantially modified versions are permitted.

The modifier may distribute, sell, monetize, or otherwise commercially use their modified version, provided that all other requirements of this license are followed.

This permission does not grant permission to sell, monetize, or redistribute the original unmodified software.

## 6. Source and Modifications

If a modified version is publicly distributed, the distributor must clearly identify that modifications were made.

The distributor is not required to use the same name as the original project, but must not imply that the modified version is the official original version.

## 7. Ownership

All original code, assets, designs, and other material created by the original author remain the property of the original author, except where otherwise stated.

This license does not transfer ownership or copyright of the original work.

## 8. Third-Party Components

This license applies only to material owned by the original author.

Third-party libraries, code, assets, or other components remain subject to their respective licenses.

## 9. Prohibited Redistribution

You may not:

1. Upload the original unmodified mod to another platform.
2. Re-upload the original mod under a different name.
3. Repackage the original mod and claim it as a new project.
4. Make only trivial changes and redistribute the result.
5. Remove or obscure the original author's attribution.
6. Claim ownership of the original work.
7. Distribute a modified version without clearly identifying it as modified.

## 10. Acceptance

By modifying, redistributing, or commercially using this software, you agree to comply with the terms of this license.

If you do not agree to these terms, you may not modify or redistribute the software.

## 11. No Warranty

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.

IN NO EVENT SHALL THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES, OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING FROM THE USE, MODIFICATION, OR DISTRIBUTION OF THE SOFTWARE.

